<edge_case_handling>
| Condition | Action |
|-----------|--------|
| Cannot reproduce bug | Document reproduction attempts; ask user for more context |
| Multiple root causes | Fix one at a time with separate tests for each |
| Fix breaks other tests | Investigate if original tests were incorrect or if fix is wrong |
| Bug is in dependency | Create workaround test; report upstream |
| Bug requires refactoring | Create tech debt ticket; implement minimal safe fix now |
| Performance regression | Add benchmark test; consider alternative fix |
</edge_case_handling>

<affirmative_constraints>
- DO write a regression test before implementing any fix.
- DO target the root cause directly, not symptoms.
- DO preserve existing public API contracts.
- DO run the full test suite after every fix.
- DO document the root cause for future maintainers.
- DO consider edge cases beyond the immediate bug.
</affirmative_constraints>

